# CLI project selection and generated artifacts. project.json carries no secret
# but records one developer's project, org and telemetry binding, and the
# artifacts are regenerated on demand. channels.json is deliberately NOT ignored:
# it is the Channel declaration, and a teammate cloning this needs it.
.copilotkit/project.json
.copilotkit/artifacts/
